	(text "FT232RNL, bus-powered. VCC = VBUS, VCCIO = 3V3OUT (3.3V I/O, 50 mA max from 3V3OUT)\nSymbol is Interface_USB:FT232RL - RNL is pin and spec identical (different fab)\nTEST tied to GND, internal oscillator (OSCI/OSCO NC), ~{RESET} NC (internal pull-up)\nFT232RL/RQ are EOL - order FT232RNL only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
